[en.FOCUS_C18_FOALS_BREATH]
Foal’s Breath

[en.FOCUS_C18_FOALS_BREATH_desc]
Five years ago, “Foal’s Breath” gently swept across the entire Kirin land, as if awakening this ancient species in its slumber.\nA five-year reform, so what is the price?

[zh.FOCUS_C18_FOALS_BREATH]
稚马之息

[zh.FOCUS_C18_FOALS_BREATH_desc]
五年前，“稚马之息”徐徐地拂过整个麒麟大地，似是唤醒了这个睡梦中的古老种族。\n一场持续五年的改革，那么，代价是什么？

